dialect protocol
protocol stdio.semio.video.diff
version 1
schema stdio.semio.video
start body
framing record

# Video wave: REAL binary diff frame, replacing the old `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary
# shortcut (`🔺️diff/🦀️component.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`). `format u8` + `presence u8`
# (bit0 = `streams` present) are two REAL fixed fields; when present, `streams` follows as one
# varint-length-prefixed opaque blob (the same `enc_streams_diff` bracket/hex text `print_diff`
# already emits) — modeled as one opaque trailing `payload` chain rather than a `Cond`-guarded
# field for the `protocol-cond-cannot-chain` reason workflow's/mesh's own diff protocols document.
# The real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` stays genuinely, fully structured (`write_str_lp`/
# `read_str_lp`, `store::pack_rt`'s real varint codec) — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
